Capstone Projects:

These projects will give you practical experience and are excellent resume material:

Deploy a Python FastAPI application to EKS using Helm and expose it with an ALB.

Build a CI/CD pipeline with Jenkins or GitHub Actions to build Docker images, push them to ECR, and deploy to EKS.

Implement autoscaling using HPA and Cluster Autoscaler (or Karpenter).

Set up centralized logging with Fluent Bit → CloudWatch or OpenSearch.

Set up monitoring with Prometheus and Grafana.

Enable GitOps with Argo CD.

Secure workloads using IRSA, Secrets, and Network Policies.

Provision the complete infrastructure using Terraform.




Focus on being able to explain and demonstrate:


✅ EKS Architecture
✅ VPC CNI
